  "prefLabel": "Fis 304.12 Further Appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 304.12 Further Appeal. Any person aggrieved may seek further review in accordance with the requirements of RSA 541 of any decision by the executive director to deny relief in an adjudicative proceeding held pursuant to Fis 304.11.\n\nSource. #13441, eff 8-29-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis300.html"
